WEBVTT

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.500
You play the most wonderful music, Grea.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:57.690
I'm really not that good.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.580
Actually, I wish I could practice more.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.920
Okay, then let's come back tomorrow.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:05.830
But we have our tests soon.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:12.290
I want to keep focused on studying,
so I won't be back here... for a while.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:15.920
Okay...

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:24.220
Mysteria Friends

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:31.250
Test Time

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.250
Well, test time is fast approaching.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.210
So if you have any questions, 
I'm available now!

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:35.000
Ms. Miranda, I need help with this part!

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.210
Me, too.

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:38.380
You can find the answers in 
the textbook, right here...

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:40.380
Huh? Where did it go?

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.580
I thought it was on this page...

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.080
Where are you going?

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.040
Everyone else seems busy 
getting ready for tests.

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:52.540
So I figured I would go and borrow
the next volume of this.

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:04.790
Hanna?

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:10.560
And so...

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.850
pieces of the ancient tree 
that grows throughout

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:17.190
Mysteria can be used in 
all sorts of medicines,

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:21.040
but in order to synthesize them successfully,
careful calculation like this is necessary.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.500
As brilliant as ever, Princess.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.700
However, the process you used to get those numbers
might be

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.750
just a little too complicated for them.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:33.750
Really?

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:39.770
Okay, let's use her work as a base and
review it once more from the top in simpler terms.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.760
Thanks so much, Hanna.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:45.210
First, let's take a look at the pieces
necessary to start the process.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:48.500
Is there anything here 
that you don't understand?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.000
Grea!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.580
Anne?

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.130
Do you need any help?

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.880
No, I'm all right.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.080
But...

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.920
You must have other things
you need to take care of, right?

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.590
I'll see you later, Anne.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.540
Oh... sure.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:23.670
Who...?

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:27.040
Anne, you're already finished?

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.350
She's too good...

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:55.830
Anne...

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:07.880
Anne?

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.170
How was the test?

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:18.120
I was lonely!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.500
Right.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:32.500
Say, would you be interested in
playing together with me?

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.630
It's been so long. I wonder if I still can?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.010
Episode 5
Academy Down

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:40.830
Mysteria Friends, episode 5: "Academy Down."

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.010
Illustration by Kihiro Kangi

00:11:55.710 --> 00:12:00.460
So basically, from this point on they just put
their fundamental theory into practice.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:04.460
Frankly, this seems outdated.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:15.460
I wonder if Grea's still awake and studying?

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:49.630
I should keep at it.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.130
I got 100 points...

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:43.010
I hope I can talk with Grea again tomorrow.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:45.170
Goodnight.
